<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Cancellation & Refund Policy - Shunyata</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Cancellation & Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-4">We understand that plans can change. Our cancellation and refund policy is designed to be transparent and fair.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">1. Cancellations</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">Guests may cancel bookings up to 7 days before the check-in date for a full refund. Cancellations within 7 days of check-in are non-refundable.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">2. Refund Process</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">Refunds, if applicable, will be processed to the original payment method within 7–10 business days.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">3. No-Show Policy</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">In case of a no-show, the booking will be considered canceled and no refund will be issued.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>